{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf","kind":"remark","title":"Categorical q-torsion leaf","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-reeb-flow"],"tags":["glossary","torsion","q-deformation","category-theory"],"defines":["categorical-q-torsion-leaf"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalQTorsionLeaf","text":"glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf\"></a><p>A <strong><dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-categorical-q-torsion-leaf\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-torsion leaf</dfn></strong> is a maximal sub-object <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L \\hookrightarrow A</code> such that:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Horizontality:</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L \\subset \\ker(\\pi_V)</code> (all forms on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L</code> are horizontal).</li>\n<li><strong>Flow invariance:</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\phi_t^q(L) = L</code> for all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">t</code> (the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Reeb flow preserves <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L</code>).</li>\n</ol>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-categorical-q-torsion-leaf.md","heading":"Remark","number":"24.5.4"}
